%description:
Tests that the path MTU discovery restores the MSS of the handshake after
pmtudTimeout when the peer sent no MSS option. The client sends no MSS option,
so the server, with an MSS of 500, keeps 500 (below the default of 536). The
error for an MTU of 400 lowers the MSS of the server to 360 at its first data
segment. With pmtudTimeout = 1s, the data at t=3 goes in segments of 500
bytes.

%inifile: omnetpp.ini
[General]
record-vector-results = false
ned-path = .;../../../../src;../../lib

cmdenv-event-banners=false
cmdenv-express-mode=false

*.testing=true
cmdenv-log-prefix="[%c]: "

sim-time-limit = 10s
*.srv_app.sendScript="1.0 1000; 3.0 1000"
*.srv_tcp.mss = 500
*.cli_tcp.sendMssOption = false
*.srv_tcp.pmtudEnabled = true
*.srv_tcp.pmtudTimeout = 1s
*.tcptester.script="b2 icmp 3 4 mtu 400"

include ../../lib/defaults.ini

%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%file: postrun.pl
open FILE, '<test.out';
while($sor = <FILE>)
{
    if ($sor =~ /^\[testing\]: (.*)$/)
    {
        print "$1\n";
    }
}
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command:  perl ./postrun.pl
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: postrun-command(1).out
[3.001 B007] A.1000 < B.2000: A 1501:2001(500) ack 1 win 16384 
[3.001 B008] A.1000 < B.2000: A 2001:2501(500) ack 1 win 16384 
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%contains: stdout
PMTUD: probe timeout elapsed, restoring snd_mss from 360 to original 500
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
%postrun-command: grep "undisposed object:" test.out > test_undisposed.out || true
%not-contains: test_undisposed.out
undisposed object: (
%#--------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
